  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p>
    <strong>Run &amp; Jump Adventure</strong><br>
    Android package: com.cloudrun.cloudhop<br>
    Last updated: October 9, 2026
  </p>

  <p>This policy explains how Run &amp; Jump Adventure handles information when you play the game or interact with its advertisements.</p>

  <p>
    <strong>Developer:</strong> READY COM<br>
    <strong>Privacy contact:</strong>
    <a href="mailto:kolonil97@outlook.com">kolonil97@outlook.com</a>
  </p>

  <h2>1. Game information stored on your device</h2>
  <p>The game stores your coins, unlocked levels and characters, best scores, level completion times and stars, cosmetic selections, and music, sound and graphics preferences on your device. This information lets the game remember your progress and settings. The current game code does not send this saved progress to a developer-operated server.</p>
  <p>The game does not require an account or ask you to provide your name, phone number or email address to play.</p>

  <h2>2. Advertising and third-party services</h2>
  <p>The app includes advertising. Rewarded videos are optional: you choose whether to watch an advertisement in exchange for the reward shown in the game.</p>
  <p>Depending on the advertising networks enabled in the released app, advertising may be provided by Google AdMob and by Unity LevelPlay mediation with ironSource Ads, Unity Ads and Meta Audience Network. Not every provider serves every advertisement.</p>
  <p>These providers may collect or receive advertising or device identifiers, IP address, approximate location inferred from IP address, device and operating-system information, app information, advertisement views and interactions, and diagnostic or performance information. The information processed depends on the provider, SDK configuration, device settings and applicable consent choices.</p>
  <p>Providers use this information to deliver and measure advertising, limit repeated advertisements, detect fraud, maintain their services and, where permitted, personalize advertising. Their processing and sharing practices are described in their policies:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>
      and
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">Google services in partner apps</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://unity.com/legal/game-player-and-app-user-privacy-policy">Unity Game Player and App User Privacy Policy</a>
      (Unity Ads, LevelPlay and ironSource services)
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/">Meta Privacy Policy</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p>The gameplay features do not request access to your contacts, camera, microphone or precise GPS location.</p>

  <h2>3. Information you send when contacting us</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we receive your email address and the information you include. We use this information to respond to your request and resolve support or privacy issues. Please do not send sensitive information that is unnecessary for your request.</p>

  <h2>4. Sharing and international processing</h2>
  <p>Advertising requests transmit information to the relevant advertising providers. Those providers may process information with their service providers and advertising partners as described in their privacy policies, including in countries other than your own. Information sent in a support request may be processed by our email service provider. We may disclose information when required by law or to respond to a valid legal request.</p>

  <h2>5. Retention and deletion</h2>
  <p>Saved game data remains in the app's local storage until you clear the app's storage or remove the app. Android backup settings may preserve or restore app data separately. Clearing app storage deletes your local progress, coins and settings.</p>
  <p>Support correspondence is retained as needed to address the request and any applicable legal obligations. Advertising providers apply their own retention periods. Uninstalling the game does not automatically delete information already held by an advertising provider; consult that provider's privacy controls or contact it to request deletion.</p>

  <h2>6. Your privacy choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You can decline optional rewarded videos. You can also manage available advertising-ID and advertising privacy controls in your Android settings and use privacy controls offered by advertising providers. Declining a rewarded video does not necessarily prevent other advertising requests when other ad formats are enabled.</p>
  <p>Depending on your location and the applicable law, you may have rights to access, correct or delete personal information, object to or restrict processing, obtain a copy of information, or withdraw consent. Contact us using the privacy email above for requests concerning information we hold. For information held by advertising providers, their policies explain how to make a request. You may also contact your local data protection authority.</p>

  <h2>7. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Run &amp; Jump Adventure is intended for users aged 13 and older and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child under 13 has provided personal information through the app or a support request, please contact us so we can investigate and take appropriate action, including deletion of information within our control.</p>
  <p>The age at which a user can independently consent to certain data processing may be higher than 13 in some locations. The game's intended audience does not replace applicable consent requirements.</p>

  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable steps to protect information within our control. No storage or transmission method can be guaranteed completely secure. Advertising providers describe their safeguards in their policies.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy when the game or its data practices change. The published policy will show the date of the latest update.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions or requests, contact READY COM at
    <a href="mailto:kolonil97@outlook.com">kolonil97@outlook.com</a>.
  </p>
